==Description==
'''Grinch Turret Charm''' is an exclusive charm introduced in [[The Final Act Event#The Final Act Battle Pass|The Final Act Battle Pass]] as a reward for reaching Level 14 on the premium track. It had a cost of {{PlushieSnowman|390}} or {{Robux|58}} ({{Robux|46}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale) to unlock it, with a total cost of {{PlushieSnowman|2,605}} or {{Robux|960}} ({{Robux|762}} during the Christmas 2025 Sale).

==Appearance==
'''Grinch Turret Charm''' has the {{Color|FinalAct|Grinch}} [[Turret]] skin on a stage with two lights. It plays the default charm placement sound. 

The color of the '''Grinch Turret Charm''' depends on the color of the player's name in chat, but it is red in its preview in the inventory.

